inductive SabbaCat | khandha | upadanakkhandha | ayatana | dhatu | sacca deriving DecidableEq, Repr

/-- sizes: 5 aggregates · 5 aggregates of clinging · 12 bases · 18 elements · 4 noble truths. -/
